     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Shihfen,<div><br></div><div>如同附圖說明, 應該是沒有載入 dplyr 套件, 因此 filter 會有錯誤.</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/attach/31c56e4e34dbf/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E9%81%B8%E5%8F%96%E8%B3%87%E6%96%99%E4%B8%AD%E7%89%B9%E5%AE%9AID_OK.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"如何選取資料中特定ID_OK.png\" width=\"297\" height=\"400\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\"></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div># 如何選取資料中特定ID</div><div># 2020.4.21</div><div><br></div><div>wages &lt;- read.table(text=&quot;</div><div>X id lnw</div><div>1 31 1.23</div><div>2 31 2.23</div><div>3 206 3.33</div><div>4 206 4.33</div><div>5 332 5.33</div><div>6 332 6.33</div><div>7 339 7.33&quot;, header=TRUE)</div><div><br></div><div>wages$id &lt;- as.character(wages$id)</div><div>str(wages)</div><div><br></div><div>newwages &lt;- filter(wages , id %in% c(&quot;206&quot;, &quot;332&quot;))</div><div><br></div><div>library(dplyr)</div><div>newwages &lt;- filter(wages , id %in% c(&quot;206&quot;, &quot;332&quot;))</div><div>newwages</div></font></div></code></div># end</div><div><br>Shihfen Peng於 2020年4月19日星期日 UTC+8下午2時16分27秒寫道：</div></div>"
    ],
